From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel Branco <miguel@raw-labs.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:58:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Disable native GitHub integration through distribution policy

Keep native account linking, publication, previews, managed identity and background lifetimes consistently unavailable while preserving ordinary Git workflows and local chat.

ClawScarf-Patch: disable-native-github
